# What never enters the build context of apps/docs/Dockerfile (the repository's root) — and so never the image. Docker reads
# this file because it sits next to the Dockerfile under its name.
#
# Every .env file of every app and package: the image gets its configuration from the environment when it runs (APP_KEY,
# APP_URL), and deploy/docs/.env holds the server's secrets — next to the compose file, inside this context.
**/.env*
# Installed and built inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.bespoke
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# What apps write when they run.
apps/*/storage
# The other apps: only their package.json — pnpm installs the workspace from the lockfile, which names them.
apps/web-app/**
!apps/web-app/package.json
apps/blank-app/**
!apps/blank-app/package.json
# Not needed to build.
.git
.github
.claude
.idea
.changeset
deploy
coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
